1
00:00:00,303 --> 00:00:02,973
Give me some time
To blow the man down

2
00:00:03,139 --> 00:00:04,929
(Leonard:)Hello?

3
00:00:05,892 --> 00:00:07,272
[IN UNISON]
Hello.

4
00:00:07,435 --> 00:00:09,855
Come quickly, lay aft
To the break of the poop

5
00:00:10,021 --> 00:00:12,981
To me way, hey
Blow the man down

6
00:00:13,149 --> 00:00:16,029
Or I'll help you along
With the toe of my boot

7
00:00:16,194 --> 00:00:18,444
PENNY & SHELDON:
Give me some time to blow the man down

8
00:00:18,613 --> 00:00:20,693
(Leonard:)What's going on?

9
00:00:21,157 --> 00:00:23,237
(Sheldon:)I assume you're referring
to the sea shanty.

10
00:00:23,409 --> 00:00:26,079
(Sheldon:)It's a rhythmic work song
to increase productivity.

11
00:00:26,245 --> 00:00:27,705
Yeah. It's crazy, but it works.

12
00:00:27,872 --> 00:00:30,912
(Penny:)Look, we made this Penny Blossom
in under three minutes.

13
00:00:31,083 --> 00:00:35,923
(Leonard:)Terrific, but that kind of raises
more questions than it answers.

14
00:00:36,088 --> 00:00:37,548
(Sheldon:)Penny's making hair accessories.

15
00:00:37,715 --> 00:00:40,095
(Sheldon:)I'm helping her optimize
her manufacturing process.

16
00:00:40,259 --> 00:00:41,339
(Sheldon:)All right, break's over.

17
00:00:41,511 --> 00:00:44,601
[SINGING] Pay attention to orders
Now you one and all

18
00:00:44,764 --> 00:00:47,604
(Howard:)- What are you using as a bonding agent?
- Hot glue.

19
00:00:47,767 --> 00:00:50,897
(Howard:)You're kidding. Any of the cyanoacrylates
would do a better job.

20
00:00:51,062 --> 00:00:54,522
- Won't work. The flower's porous.
- What if we infused the bottom layer...

21
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:57,360
...with silicone RTV
to provide a better mounting surface?

22
00:00:57,527 --> 00:01:00,027
(Sheldon:)Intriguing.

